# The root .gitignore drops every image and every build product. This folder is
# the "build + docs" bundle, so the pictures the docs refer to are let back in
# (those under oled_preview/ are the same ones shown in the keymap folder),
# along with the flashable .uf2 and the generated index.html.
#
# The intermediate products stay ignored: .hex / .bin / .elf / .map are derived
# from the same build, are large, and change on every rebuild.
!*.png
!*.gif
!*.uf2
!index.html

# The LED effect harness is a host binary (arm64 macOS), not a firmware image:
# rebuild it with `cd led_effects && bash build.sh` instead of committing it.
led_effects/harness
led_effects/*.dSYM/
__pycache__/
